        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "There are a variety of ways to do this, but you can do what you suggested by replacing the new file by deleting the existing one and adding the updated one.  However you may not need to create a new chat, it would be better to go into the same chat with the finalized artifact & just make the revision there.  You will be able to see all your artifacts from the past & thats why its good to date them.  Hope that helps.  ",
                "type": "text",
                "circle_ios_fallback_text": "There are a variety of ways to do this, but you can do what you suggested by replacing the new file by deleting the existing one and adding the updated one.  However you may not need to create a new chat, it would be better to go into the same chat with the finalized artifact & just make the revision there.  You will be able to see all your artifacts from the past & thats why its good to date them.  Hope that helps.  "
              }
